      489.04
    ],
    "text": "Regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      49.89,
      497.89,
      539.75,
      520.96
    ],
    "text": "I do hereby amend the Sections 13 and 17 of regulations published on National Sports Associations No. 1 of 2013published in the Gazette (Extraordinary) No. 1793/03 dated 15th January 2013 as follows :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      81.33,
      533.89,
      539.93,
      556.96
    ],
    "text": "(1) In Regulation 13(1) by substitution of words \u2018\u2018any of the above positions\u2019\u2019 given after the words, \u201cany person\u201dof the words \u2018\u2018the same office\u2019\u2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      81.33,
      569.89,
      454.9,
      580.96
    ],
    "text": "(2) By insertion the following new proviso immediately after the proviso in Regulation 13(2),",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      97.89,
      593.89,
      539.92,
      616.96
    ],
    "text": "\u2018\u2018Provided further that the aggregate period of four years should be computed from fifteenth (15th) January 2013,the date the Regulations came into operation.\u2019\u2019",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      81.33,
      629.89,
      464.61,
      640.96
    ],
    "text": "(3) In Regulation 17, by substitution of words \u2018\u2018by secret vote\u2019\u2019 of words \u2018\u2018by show of hands\u2019\u2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
